<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank says ready to intervene again on crown.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank says ready to intervene again on crown.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) on Thursday said it had intervened on the forex market to support the crown, and was prepared to do so again &quot;if needed&quot;.</p>
<p>&quot;If needed, the CNB is ready for further intervention,&quot; a CNB statement said.</p>
</text>
